g roads after Albert Luthuli, Amy Biehl, Ray Alexander, and the Gugulethu Seven. Not everyone agrees about the origin of this street naming system. Resident Jeff Mamputha believes that the \\\"NY ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.capetownmuseum.org.za/places/gugulethu\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d6\"},\"ref\":\"d6\",\"snippet\":\" ... Europe, Barcelona, Kanana, Lusaka, New Rest, Gugulethu SP, Phola Park, Vukuzenzele, and Zondi. According to Jasmina Brankovic, violence in Gugulethu is structural as well as historical. It is institutionalized in inequalities of power, which in turn restrict life opportunities for individuals, especially young people.\\n\\nBecoming a gang: Street ... \",\"title\":\"https://kujenga-amani.ssrc.org/2018/04/25/gang-violence-in-gugulethu-south-africa-notes-from-the-field/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d21\"},\"ref\":\"d21\",\"snippet\":\" ... Parks Tau (until 2020) Obed Bapela (2019–2023)Thembi Nkadimeng (2021–2023)\\nterm_start2: 30 May 2019\\nterm_end2: 6 March 2023\\npredecessor2: Zweli Mkhize\\nsuccessor2: Thembi Nkadimeng\\noffice3: Minister in the Presidency\\npresident3: Cyril Ramaphosa\\nterm_start3: 28 February 2018\\nterm_end3: 29 May 2019\\npredecessor3: Jeff ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nkosazana_Dlamini-Zuma\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d19\"},\"ref\":\"d19\",\"snippet\":\" ... What should I do if my street name no longer exists?\\n\\nCities grow and change over time. Part of that process may involve changing the street names. The further back in time one goes, the greater the chance that the street has been renamed or the houses renumbered ... \",\"title\":\"https://stevemorse.org/census/faq.htm\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d22\"},\"ref\":\"d22\",\"snippet\":\" ... The United States Post Office operates three post offices nearby:\\n* Flushing Station – 41–65 Main Street\\n* Linden Hill Station – 29–50 Union Street\\n* Station A – 40–03 164th Street\\n\\nZIP Codes prefixed with 113 are administered from a sectional center at the Flushing Post Office. The 113-prefixed ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flushing,_Queens\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d23\"},\"ref\":\"d23\",\"snippet\":\" ... Pharmaceutical names are assigned according to a scheme in which specific syllables in the drug name (called stems) convey information about the chemical structure, action, or indication of the drug. The name also includes a prefix that is distinct from other drug names and that is euphonious, memorable ... \",\"title\":\"https://journalofethics.ama-assn.org/article/how-do-drugs-get-named/2019-08\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d13\"},\"ref\":\"d13\",\"snippet\":\" ... 2013-11-08\\n---\\nGugulethu Township is located on the Cape Flats and situated 18km south-east of Cape Town in the Western Cape Province. The name is Xhosa for 'our pride'. The township was established in 1958 and was originally named Nyanga West. Roads, sewers, water and drainage ... \",\"title\":\"https://sahistory.org.za/place/gugulethu-township\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d24\"},\"ref\":\"d24\",\"snippet\":\" ... 2014-10-04\\n---\\nname: Loyiso Gola\\nbirth_date: 16 May 1983\\nbirth_place: Gugulethu, Cape Town, South Africa\\nmedium: Stand-up, television\\nnationality: South African\\nactive: 2002–presentNewman Latoya Long live President Loyiso Gola! 5 October 2014 IOL Tonight 28 February 2012 6 October 2014 liveMusila Grace A ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Loyiso_Gola\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"8eac88bc6f07bd671d96a1de83b5a9d13e37e3b34f1a650e2296684475b0f435\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"f03cdcf42bc4632ca3431cf546c31723657814c872fd918fc055930a34b49a8d\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Gugulethu street names NY prefix renamed 2018 2019\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d2\"},\"ref\":\"d2\",\"snippet\":\" ... suburbs, the original streets in Gugulethu were labelled on a grid using NY or \\\"Native Yard\\\" and a number. Due to the offensive nature of this remnant of apartheid town planning, many people advocated for name changes for these streets. Authorities responded by renaming many roads including changing ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.capetownmuseum.org.za/places/gugulethu\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d6\"},\"ref\":\"d6\",\"snippet\":\" ... Gugulethu Township\\n\\nWe focus on the practices of gang violence in Gugulethu, a black township established in 1960 as a result of overcrowding in the first black residential area of Langa, also in Cape Town. Initially, barrack-like homes/hostels were built in Gugulethu to provide boarding quarters ... \",\"title\":\"https://kujenga-amani.ssrc.org/2018/04/25/gang-violence-in-gugulethu-south-africa-notes-from-the-field/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d25\"},\"ref\":\"d25\",\"snippet\":\" ... the \\\"Pride\\\" of Gugulethu\\ndate: 2013-06-26\\n---\\nMzoli's: the \\\"Pride\\\" of Gugulethu\\n\\nMzoli's Place, also known simply as Mzoli's, is a butchery-come-restaurant. Situated in the heart of Gugulethu, a Cape Town township whose name means \\\"Our Pride\\\", Mzoli's is one of ... \",\"title\":\"https://groundup.org.za/article/mzolis-pride-gugulethu_1056/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d13\"},\"ref\":\"d13\",\"snippet\":\" ... in search of work. Township residents experienced discrimination on a daily basis.\\n\\nForced removals in Gugulethu\\n\\nGugulethu residents included Africans forcibly moved from Windermere when it was declared a Coloured area. An estimated number of 735 families were moved from Windermere to Gugulethu. Windermere is an urban area ... \",\"title\":\"https://sahistory.org.za/place/gugulethu-township\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d26\"},\"ref\":\"d26\",\"snippet\":\" ... The Langa students march with placards through their township streets accompanied by their teachers who try to keep order. Students are also under police surveillance and 33 people are shot dead, among them 18 year old Xolile Mosi. The police stop the Gugulethu march and students are told ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.sahistory.org.za/article/history-education-1658-present\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d27\"},\"ref\":\"d27\",\"snippet\":\" ... History in the making as Gugulethu poised to unveil new emblem to mark Heritage Day\\nauthor: Thulani Magazi\\ndate: 2022-09-16\\n---\\nDesigned and developed as one of many townships under the notorious Group Areas Act, Gugulethu will once again be etched in the history books with the ... \",\"title\":\"https://cityvision.co.za/history-in-the-making-as-gugulethu-poised-to-unveil-new-emblem-to-mark-heritage-day-20220915/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d24\"},\"ref\":\"d24\",\"snippet\":\" ... Early life and education\\n\\nGola is Xhosa, and was born on 16 May 1983 in the Cape Town township of Gugulethu. He moved away from Gugulethu at the age of 14, and attended Zonnebloem Nest Senior School in Woodstock.\\n\\nGola describes himself as \\\"very reserved and shy\\\" before ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Loyiso_Gola\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d28\"},\"ref\":\"d28\",\"snippet\":\" ... Read on... -\\n\\nTown of Hempstead Partners with New York Islanders to Rename Street at UBS Arena to NY ISLANDERS WAY\\n\\nSupervisor Clavin, Islanders Co-Owner Jon Ledecky and UBS Arena President Kim Stone to Unveil Permanent Street Sign Read on... -\\n\\nClavin & Council Members Team with MSSN to Provide ... \",\"title\":\"https://hempsteadny.gov/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"2290c92d56c2b9c67d4634c857be49ed8d4214aba62f2813d645e46ddae24f27\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"506d33c5e7e1cb24d0b13fb263a4ad5fba68d12ccdfd0902cf6d4a105ff84cdd\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Gugulethu township streets NY numbering renamed article\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"